Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 08:46:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 036/104] feat: improve WineHua audio and graphics smoke
 diagnostics

1. Expand winehua_audio_smoke to pick an audio file, decode MP3 through mpg123 before falling back to MCI, and keep WAV playback on the AudioClient path.

2. Link the audio smoke program with mpg123/comdlg32/shlwapi so the sample can validate local media selection and larger WAV/decoded buffers.

3. Extend winehua_graphics_smoke diagnostics to print presenter, damage-upload, native-buffer, zero-copy, fallback, and transport environment state for GL benchmark runs.
